<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Usinimas begun.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Usinimas begun.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said on Wednesday it started coverage of Brazilian steelmaker Usinimas by adding it to the firm's recomended list.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock last traded at 10.79 reais in Brazil.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
